New\"'>RADIOGRAPH OF\r\nBARIUM SWALLOW OESOPHAGUS<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>--------Barium\r\nswallow was done using liquid barium.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>--------Smooth\r\n&amp; uninterrupted flow of barium noted through <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\noesophagus.No persistant luminal narrowing \/ intraluminal <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nmass lesion seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>--------Normal\r\noesophageal mucosa is well delineated.no obvious <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nmucosal distortion noted.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>--------Normal\r\noesophageal constrictions are noted.No abnormal(tertiary)<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\ncontractions seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>--------Valleculae\r\n\/ Pyriform sinus appear normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>--------Normal\r\nsmooth flow noted across gastro-oesophageal junction.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\